    "Built for the next generation of e-commerce":"Für die nächste Generation des E-Commerce entwickelt","Platform":"Plattform","Solutions":"Lösungen","Integrations":"Integrationen","Get started":"Loslegen",
    "E-COMMERCE SEARCH INTELLIGENCE":"SUCHINTELLIGENZ FÜR E-COMMERCE","Your store deserves":"Dein Shop verdient es","to be":"","found.":"gefunden zu werden.",
